[6913]="7006EADF\n1\tTalk to Gadâr within Dâr Laja\tGuard-captain Gadâr stands prepared to defend you within Dâr Laja.\n2\tFollow Gadâr and remain under his protection\tGadâr has sworn to protect you. You should stay close to him.\n3\tTalk to Jaith inside Dâr Laja\tJaith has entered Dâr Laja with information about what transpires in the city.\n4\tReturn to the safety of the main hall of Dâr Laja\tYour guards have left Dâr Laja to prevent the uprising from entering the Meeting-hall and doing you some harm. You should return to the main hall and stay away from the entrance!\n5\tTalk to Khôltekh in the main hall of Dâr Laja\tKhôltekh motions for you to speak to him.\n6\tFlee through Umbar-môkh to safety!\tThe catacombs of Umbar-môkh may allow you to flee the uprising and escape to safety!\n7\tTalk to Khôltekh in Umbar-môkh\tKhôltekh has led you into Umbar-môkh, through which you must find safety!\n8\tFollow Khôltekh through Umbar-môkh to safety\tKhôltekh hopes to lead you through Umbar-môkh to safety!\n9\tTalk to the Temámir guardsman barring your passage\tTemámir soldiers bar your passage.\n10\tTemámir soldiers bar your passage\tTemámir soldiers bar your passage.\n11\tTalk to Khôltekh and demand an explanation\tKhôltekh had better have an explanation for this insult!\n12\tKhôltekh nods in the direction of the waggons to the north.\t\n",
[6914]="700301C8\n1\tObjetivo 1: Habla con Elfhelm\tHabla con Elfhelm. ¡Él te conducirá hasta las puertas de Recodo de la Crecida!\n2\tObjetivo 2: Cabalga y arrolla a las fuerzas desmontadas.\tElfhelm te ha pedido que cabalgues y rechaces a las fuerzas enemigas. Los caballos han muerto, los refuerzos llegan tarde y solo tú puedes detener la amenaza.\n3\tObjetivo 3: Derrota a los enemigos del camino\tContinúa por el valle. Debes dar caza al jinete nazgûl.\n4\tObjetivo 4: Derrota a los enemigos restantes del camino\tContinúa por el valle. Debes dar caza al jinete nazgûl.\n5\tObjetivo 5: Derrota al nazgûl\tAl final del valle te espera el jinete nazgûl. ¡Derrótalo y recupera Recodo de la Crecida para Rohan!\n6\tObjetivo 6: Habla con Elfhelm\tHabla con Elfhelm de nuevo.\n",
[6915]="70031061\n1\tHabla con el joven Thane\tEl pueblo de Recodo de la Crecida está siendo asediado por las fuerzas de Jóshkhin Orda, liderados por el Sureño Sombrío, quien ha reagrupado al ejército rechazado. ¡Debes proteger el Salón del Hidromiel, y al joven Thane de Recodo de la Crecida!\n2\tHabla con Radwig\tRadwig está en el Salón del Hidromiel de Recodo de la Crecida, esperando la llegada de las fuerzas de Mordor, dirigidas por el Sureño Sombrío.\n3\tProtege el Salón del Hidromiel de las fuerzas de Mordor\tRadwig está en el Salón del Hidromiel de Recodo de la Crecida.\n4\tHabla con Radwig\tEl Salón del Hidromiel de Recodo de la Crecida ha sido defendido conéxito, y Radwig quiere felicitarte y agradecerte tu ayuda.\n",
[6916]="7006EB8C\n1\tJoin Mizâdi at Eshtali's tomb\tJoin Mizâdi at Eshtali's tomb.\n2\tSpeak with Mizâdi by Eshtali's tomb\tSpeak with Mizâdi by Eshtali's tomb.\n3\tPlace the flowers on Eshtali's tomb (total: 3)\tPlace the flowers on Eshtali's tomb.\n4\tListen to Mizâdi\tListen to Mizâdi.\n5\tOffer comfort to Mizâdi\tOffer comfort to Mizâdi.\n",
[6917]="70035CBF\n1\tHabla con Barallas\tBarallas se encuentra a las afueras de Drû Vádokan. Barallas y los demás han viajado a Drû Vádokan y ahora están listos para arrasar con lo que queda de las fuerzas orcas en el Bosque Funesto. Deberías hablar con él mientras esperas a que lleguen los demás.\n2\tEspera a que los Ents lleguen a las afueras de Drû Vádokan\tBarallas está a las afueras de Drû Vádokan. Deberías esperar a que lleguen los demás Ents antes de comenzar el asalto.\n3\tHabla con Barallas\tBarallas y los demás Ents están fuera de Drû Vádokan. Los Ents están listos para asaltar Drû Vádokan. Deberías hablar con Barallas y comenzar el asalto.\n4\tSigue a Barallas y a los Ents hasta la puerta\tBarallas y los Ents están marchando para asaltar Drû Vádokan. Deberías seguir a Barallas y a los demás Ents mientras avanzan hacia la puerta de Drû Vádokan.\n5\tLucha a través de Drû Vádokan\tBarallas y los Ents están atacando Drû Vádokan. Deberías seguirlos en la batalla para asegurar su éxito.\n6\tAcércate a Voskor\tVoskor está en el medio de Drû Vádokan. Deberías acercarte a Voskor y enfrentarte a él junto con los Ents del Bosque Funesto.\n7\tDerrota a Voskor\tVoskor se encuentra dentro de Drû Vádokan. Barallas y los Ents han descubierto a un vil Uruk que lidera las fuerzas orcas en el Bosque Funesto, pero parece estar herido.\n",
[6918]="7005339F\n1\tFind Déagol in Tûn Melen\tYou are at home in Tûn Melen, and you have much on your mind. You should find Déagol.\n",
[6919]="70037156\n1\tTalk to Tordag\tSpeak with Tordag.\n2\tFight to the heart of Torsbury\tFight to the heart of Torsbury.\n3\tDefeat Bartub and his minions\tDefeat Bartub, Captain of the Uruk-hai at Torsbury.\n4\tTalk to Torferth\tSpeak with Torferth to learn his orders.\n",
[6920]="700582B6\n1\tTalk to Léothred\tTalk to Léothred.\n2\tListen to Fróthi and Léothred's tale\tListen to Fróthi and Léothred's tale.\n3\tTalk to Fróthi\tTalk to Fróthi.\n",
[6921]="70053B31\n1\tListen to the words of Bozhéna in the Halls of Memory\tBozhéna has made her own contributions to the Halls of Memory.\n2\tListen to the words of Bozhéna on the slopes of Mordor, as depicted by the Halls of Memory\tBozhéna has made her own contributions to the Halls of Memory.\n3\tBozhéna has made her own contributions to the Halls of Memory.\t\n4\tListen to the words of Vóin, as remembered by Bozhéna\tBozhéna has made her own contributions to the Halls of Memory.\n5\tListen to the words of Bozhéna\tBozhéna has made her own contributions to the Halls of Memory.\n6\tListen to the words of Vóin, as remembered by Bozhéna\tBozhéna has made her own contributions to the Halls of Memory.\n7\tTalk to Bozhéna on the slopes of Mordor, as depicted by the Halls of Memory\tBozhéna will pick up the tale on the slopes of Mordor, as depicted by the Halls of Memory.\n8\tBozhéna has made her own contributions to the Halls of Memory.\t\n9\tListen to the words of Bozhéna\tBozhéna has made her own contributions to the Halls of Memory.\n10\tHear the words of Vóin, as recorded by Bozhéna\tAs the end of his years approached, Vóin took one last journey to the Grey Mountains.\n11\tHear the words of Vóin, as recorded by Bozhéna\tAs the end of his years approached, Vóin took one last journey to the Grey Mountains.\n12\tHear the conclusion of Bozhéna's account, secretly recorded in the Black Book\tAs the end of his years approached, Vóin took one last journey to the Grey Mountains.\n",
[6922]="700037EE\n1\tHabla con Frodo\tFrodo está fuera de La Última Morada, tomando el aire nocturno. Gandalf el Gris te pidió que caminaras con Frodo Bolsón y evaluaras su estado de ánimo.\n2\tCamina con Frodo\tFrodo está en los senderos fuera de La Última Morada, tomando el aire nocturno. Gandalf el Gris te pidió que caminaras con Frodo Bolsón y evaluaras su estado de ánimo.\n3\tCamina con Frodo\tFrodo está en los senderos fuera de La Última Morada, tomando el aire nocturno. Gandalf el Gris te pidió que caminaras con Frodo Bolsón y evaluaras su estado de ánimo.\n4\tCamina con Frodo\tFrodo está en los senderos fuera de La Última Morada, tomando el aire nocturno. Gandalf el Gris te pidió que caminaras con Frodo Bolsón y evaluaras su estado de ánimo.\n5\tHabla con Frodo\tFrodo está en una bifurcación de caminos no muy lejos de La Última Morada. Tu paseo con Frodo parece haber aliviado algunas de sus preocupaciones.\n",
[6923]="700375D0\n1\tHabla con Burnoth\tThe armies of the White Hand are attacking the Hornburg. You should speak at once with Burnoth.\n2\tDefend the Hornburg against the White Hand\tThe forces of the White Hand are attacking the Hornburg. Aid the Rohirrim against their enemy.\n3\tDefend the Hornburg against the White Hand\tThe forces of the White Hand are attacking the Hornburg. Aid the Rohirrim against their enemy.\n4\tDefend the Hornburg against the White Hand\tThe forces of the White Hand are attacking the Hornburg. Aid the Rohirrim against their enemy.\n5\tHabla con Burnoth\tYou should speak with Burnoth at once.\n",
[6924]="70032B6C\n1\tEstás [según el diario] y experimentas un sueño muy extraño...\tEstás atrapado en un sueño peculiar.\n2\tEstás [según el diario] y soñando.\tEstás atrapado en un sueño.\n",
[6925]="7007213B\n1\tTalk to Ebuzâm\tYou have travelled to the prison of Esh Mêkag with Ebuzâm. You should talk to Ebuzâm.\n2\tTalk to the Ordâkhai guard\tThe door deeper into the prison is locked and guarded. You should talk to the Ordâkhai guard and convince him to let you pass.\n3\tCollect Ordâkhai weapons (total: 3)\tYou have made it past the first gate. You should discreetly collect any Ordâkhai weapons you find.\n4\tArm imprisoned thralls (total: 2)\tYou have collected enough weapons to arm the prisoners and stage a riot. You should free and arm any imprisoned thralls you find.\n5\tEnter the torture chamber\tEbuzâm wants to enter the torture chamber to free anyone inside. You should enter the torture chamber.\n6\tDefeat Esh Mêkag torturers (total: 4)\030Arm imprisoned thralls (total: 3)\tYou have found several prisoners being tortured in the torture chamber. You should defeat the torturers and arm any imprisoned thralls you find.\n7\tEnter the next cell block\tYou have cleared the torture chamber. You should continue to the next cell block.\n8\tArm imprisoned thralls (total: 6)\tYou have cleared the torture chamber, but have yet to find Ratúlko the Bloody. You should continue forward and arm any imprisoned thralls you find.\n9\tEnter the execution chamber\tThere is one chamber left. You should enter the execution chamber.\n10\tBreak binding chains (total: 4)\030Arm imprisoned thralls (total: 4)\tRatúlko the Bloody is busy having a conversation with Góramul Sai. You should quietly free and arm the prisoners in the execution chamber while they are talking.\n11\tEavesdrop on the conversation\tRatúlko the Bloody is having a conversation with Góramul Sai. You should listen to their conversation. What they say might be valuable information to Mizâdi's cause.\n12\tTalk to Ratúlko the Bloody\tRatúlko the Bloody has noticed you. You should talk to Ratúlko the Bloody and try to convince him you are just a guard.\n13\tSurvive Ratúlko's attack\tRatúlko the Bloody has discovered your true identity! You should fight for your life!\n",
[6926]="7004544C\n1\tFollow Rhûd-pulo-Drât\tFollow Rhûd-pulo-Drât to Luk Khakát.\n2\tLet Rhûd-pulo-Drât perform his ritual\tLet Rhûd-pulo-Drât perform his ritual.\n3\tDefeat the Dheghûn\tDefeat the Dheghûn in the glade.\n4\tSpeak with Rhûd-pulo-Drât\tYou should speak with Rhûd-pulo-Drât.\n",
[6927]="70029B2D\n1\tHabla con Franis para avanzar por el pantano\tFranis te espera en el Pantano Bruno. Debes hablar con Franis.\n2\tDerrota a los avanc en el primer estanque\tLos avanc rodean los estanques donde podría encontrarse una reliquia de fuerza empapada. Debes derrotar a los avanc para poder pescar en paz en los estanques.\n3\tPesca una reliquia de fuerza empapada\tEs probable que encuentres una reliquia de fuerza empapada en los estanques cercanos. Debes usar tu habilidad de pesca para intentar atrapar una reliquia.\n4\tSigue a Franis hasta los estanques custodiados por tortugas\tFranis te espera para que vuelvas a hablar con él. Debes hablar con Franis; su conocimiento del Pantano Bruno te guiará hacia los estanques más prometedores.\n5\tDerrota a cada una de las tortugas\tLas tortugas deambulan por el estanque al que Franis te llevó. Debes derrotar a las tortugas que retozan en esta zona para poder pescar en paz cuando todo haya terminado.\n6\tPesca un sello de paciencia embarrado\tEs probable que encuentres un sello de paciencia embarrado en los estanques cercanos. Debes usar tu habilidad de pesca para intentar atrapar una reliquia.\n7\tHabla con Franis\tFranis te espera para que vuelvas a hablar con él. Debes hablar con Franis; su conocimiento del Pantano Bruno te guiará hacia los estanques más prometedores.\n8\tDerrota a todos los elhudans alrededor de este estanque\tLos elhudans rodean los estanques de esta zona del Pantano Bruno, proyectando su luz maligna sobre tus cautelosos rostros. Debes derrotar a todos los elhudans de esta zona.\n9\tPesca una reliquia de fuego interior brillante\tEs probable que encuentres una reliquia de fuego interior brillante en los estanques cercanos. Debes usar tu habilidad de pesca para intentar atrapar una reliquia.\n10\tHabla con Franis\tFranis te espera para que vuelvas a hablar con él. Debes hablar con Franis; su conocimiento del Pantano Bruno te guiará hacia los estanques más prometedores.\n11\tDerrota a todas las babosas\tLas babosas se arrastran alrededor de los estanques a los que Franis te ha llevado. Debes derrotar a todas las babosas de esta zona antes de intentar pescar aquí.\n12\tPesca una reliquia del tiempo desgastada\tEs probable que encuentres una reliquia del tiempo desgastada en los estanques cercanos. Debes usar tu habilidad de pesca para intentar atrapar una reliquia.\n13\tHabla con Franis\tFranis te espera para que vuelvas a hablar con él. Debes hablar con Franis; su conocimiento del Pantano Bruno te guiará hacia los estanques más prometedores.\n14\tDerrota a todos los acechadores del pantano en esta zona\tFranis te ha llevado a un estanque que está rodeado de acechadores del pantano amenazantes. Debes derrotar a todos los acechadores del pantano para poder pescar en paz.\n15\tPesca una reliquia de astucia goteante\tEs probable que encuentres una reliquia de astucia goteante en los estanques cercanos. Debes usar tu habilidad de pesca para intentar atrapar una reliquia.\n16\tHabla con Franis\tFranis te espera para que vuelvas a hablar con él. Debes hablar con Franis; su conocimiento del Pantano Bruno te ha guiado con éxito hacia los estanques más prometedores.\n",
[6928]="7004A8DD\n1\tTalk to Legolas in the Tower of Cirith Ungol\tLegolas is standing in the Tower of Cirith Ungol. You and Legolas plan to distract the spiders of Shelob's brood at the Under-gate to allow Belzagar to send word to Ugrukhôr and Rûkhor the Pale Herald. You should speak to Legolas when you are prepared.\n2\tFind a path through the Tower of Cirith Ungol\tYou are searching for a path to the tower-gate with Legolas. Remain on guard.\n3\tStand against Shelob's children at the Under-gate\tYou have come to the Under-gate and should now guard Belzagar's escape from Cirith Ungol.\n4\tPursue Shelob's children into Torech Ungol\tShelob's children have fled back beyond the Under-gate toward the tunnels of Torech Ungol. You should pursue them and prevent more from entering the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\n5\tDefeat Saernaston\tYou have been cornered in the depths of Cirith Ungol by the ancient spider, Saernaston. You must defeat him if you hope to escape!\n6\tTalk to Legolas at the Under-gate\tLegolas is standing near the shattered remains of the Under-gate. Saernaston appears to have been devoured by Shelob herself. Belzagar has fled the tower, and now you and Legolas should as well.\n",
[6929]="7006987E\n1\tTalk to Sirgon below the Hungry Deep Tavern\tSirgon waits below the stairs that climb to the Hungry Deep Tavern.\n2\tClimb up to the Hungry Deep Tavern with Sirgon\tYou have agreed to stand by Sirgon with much of your crew while he meets with Belondor.\n3\tStand by Sirgon while he meets with Belondor\tYou have agreed to stand by Sirgon with much of your crew while he meets with Belondor.\n4\tTalk to Belondor at the Hungry Deep Tavern\tBelondor wants to speak with you about the events that transpired beneath the Mâkhda Khorbo.\n5\tStand by Sirgon while he meets with Belondor\tYou have agreed to stand by Sirgon with much of your crew while he meets with Belondor.\n6\tTalk to Mêshka at the Hungry Deep Tavern\tBelondor's wife Mêshka has arrived at the Hungry Deep Tavern, and she is not pleased to see that Sirgon has violated her ban upon returning to the Upper Ward.\n7\tStand by Sirgon while he meets with Belondor\tYou have agreed to stand by Sirgon with much of your crew while he meets with Belondor.\n8\tTalk to Sirgon at the Hungry Deep Tavern\tSirgon is compelled to speak on behalf of King Elessar.\n9\tRemain alert to see what Rothog will do\tRothog the Storm has questions for Belondor.\n10\tTalk to Belondor at the Hungry Deep Tavern\tBelondor wishes to speak with you at the Hungry Deep Tavern.\n11\tRothog the Storm has something to say to you.\t\n",
[6930]="70006FAE\n1\tHas acompañado a Dwalin a la sala del trono de la Mansión de Thorin. Deberías hablar con él antes de confrontar a Gormr.\t\n2\tEn lugar de confrontar a Gormr, lo encontraste rodeado de trasgos. Con la distracción que provocaste, logró escapar, pero Marrec envió trasgos a atacarte. Debes defenderte.\t\n3\tHas derrotado a los trasgos, pero Dwalin ha caído. Deberías atenderlo.\t\n4\tSigue a Marrec.\tDwalin te ordena seguir a Marrec y detenerlo antes de que robe Hen-heledh a Gormr.\n5\tHabla con Gormr Doursmith\tHas encontrado a Gormr, mortalmente herido por Marrec. Deberías hablar con él mientras aún vive.\n6\tSigue a Marrec.\tMarrec ha robado el Espejo de Visión a Gormr. No debe escapar de la Mansión de Thorin con Hen-heledh.\n7\tConfronta a Marrec.\tMarrec ha derribado a Dwalin, dejándote solo para evitar su huida.\n8\tCon Marrec muerto y Hen-heledh a salvo, deberías atender a Dwalin.\t\n9\tHabla con Mathi Stouthand\tDwalin informa a Mathi Manofirme, quien acaba de entrar, que tú le contarás la historia de tu batalla contra Marrec.\n10\tMientras hablabas con Mathi, la dama Arwen entró y comenzó a atender las heridas de Dwalin. Deberías hablar con ella para saber cómo está.\t\n",
[6931]="70042DEF\n1\tTalk to Derufin within Osgiliath\tYou have made your way with Derufin into enemy-occupied Osgiliath in search of the mighty ram Grond.\n2\tTalk to Derufin and ask him about the dreadful, ghostly images\tDerufin is within the city of Osgiliath, helping you search for Grond, the mighty weapon of the enemy. You experienced an overpowering feeling of dread within the city of Osgiliath, and felt the presence of ghostly images, but Derufin does not seem to have noticed any of the strange occurrences.\n3\tTalk to Derufin within Osgiliath\tDerufin is within Osgiliath, and has expressed concern over the increasingly potent visions you have experienced within the city.\n4\tTravel north through Osgiliath in search of Grond\tDerufin has asked you to travel north through Osgiliath while he searches to the east for his brother Duilin and for Grond.\n5\tTravel north through Osgiliath in search of Grond\tDerufin has asked you to travel north through Osgiliath while he searches to the east for his brother Duilin and for Grond.\n6\tGive your last respects to Golodir\tCan it be? How did Golodir come to Osgiliath before you, and what evil befell him here?\n7\tFind Grond somewhere within Osgiliath\tYou are drawn to the north-east... is that where Grond may be found?\n8\tYou have found Grond, and the mighty ram is undefended. Now is the time for you to damage its great wheels.\t\n9\tTalk to Derufin by the mighty ram Grond\tDerufin and Duilin have caught up with you and marvel at the sheer size of the mighty ram Grond.\n10\tTalk to Duilin by the mighty ram Grond\tDerufin and Duilin have caught up with you and marvel at the sheer size of the mighty ram Grond.\n11\tStand with Duilin and Derufin within Osgiliath\tA terrifying foe has come to Osgiliath.\n",
[6932]="70053A35\n1\tTalk to Ayorzén outside Barad Cúron\tAyorzén has disguised himself as Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior, and plans to bring you inside Barad Cúron as his prisoner.\n2\tGo with the disguised Ayorzén to Barad Cúron, pretending to be his prisoner\tAyorzén has disguised himself as Karazgar, the Weeping Warrior, and now he attempts to bring you and the Ranger Culang into Barad Cúron as his prisoners.\n3\tEnter Barad Cúron and confront Gothmog\tThe watchful presence that guards the entrance to Barad Cúron has given you leave to enter the tower.\n4\tInside Barad Cúron, the wraith Gothmog attempts to demoralize you with painful memories of the past.\t\n5\tInside Barad Cúron, the wraith Gothmog attempts to demoralize you with painful memories of the past.\t\n6\tSurvive the further assaults of Gothmog\tGothmog has not yet exhausted his powers. With his illusions defeated he redoubles his attack!\n7\tDraw upon the memory of Narmeleth for inspiration\030Draw upon the memory of Golodir for inspiration\030Draw upon the memory of Isildur for inspiration\030Draw upon the memory of Anárion for inspiration\030Draw upon the memory of Elendil for inspiration\tCulang believes you should use Gothmog's own weapons against him, reminding the wraith of those heroes who stood against darkness despite the evils arrayed against them. It is Culang's hope that the light of their inspiration will serve to weaken the wraith, sapping him of his strength.\n8\tDefeat Gothmog\tBoth weakened and enraged by your defiance, Gothmog presses the attack!\n",
[6933]="70033334\n1\tHabla con Svanr\tSvanr se encuentra en la Primera Sala de Nud-melek.\n2\tSigue a Svanr hasta el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío\tSvanr se encuentra fuera de Moria, en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío. Debes hablar con Svanr.\n3\tHabla con alguien en Mekhem-bizru\tMekhem-bizru se encuentra al final del camino que parte de la Puerta Este de Moria.\n4\tHabla con un enano al borde del Lago Espejo\tKheled-zâram es el gran lago que se encuentra en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío. Debes hablar con un enano que contemple Kheled-zâram.\n5\tMira el Lago Espejo desde Mekhem-bizru\tEl Lago Espejo, también llamado Kheled-zâram, es el lago que se encuentra junto a Mekhem-bizru en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío. Debes mirar el Lago Espejo desde Mekhem-bizru. NOTA: Esta misión requiere emotes.\n6\tVuelve con Svanr\tSvanr se encuentra en el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío. Debes hablar con Svanr.\n",
[6934]="7004E636\n1\tTalk to Hrostyr, King Thorin's personal guard\tKing Thorin has chosen to hear Authi Gem-cutter's grievance, but he will not do so at his throne.\n2\tAccompany Authi as he presents his case before King Thorin\tKing Thorin has chosen to go among his people for the hearing of Authi's complaint.\n3\tListen to Khîl's response before the king\tKing Thorin has chosen to go among his people for the hearing of Authi's complaint.\n4\tHabla con el rey Thorin\tKing Thorin has chosen to go among his people for the hearing of Authi's complaint.\n5\tListen to the judgement of King Thorin\tKing Thorin has chosen to go among his people for the hearing of Authi's complaint.\n6\tTalk to Authi\tAuthi has heard the king's judgement and now wishes to speak with you.\n",
[6935]="70037C83\n1\tTalk to Hildith\tHildith is in the jail of Grimslade. You should speak with Hildith.\n2\tListen to Hildith's decision\tHildith is in the jail of Grimslade.\n3\tSpeak with Hildith\tHildith is in the jail of Grimslade. You should speak with Hildith.\n4\tFollow Hildith\tHildith has gone to the front gate of Grimslade. You should speak with Hildith.\n5\tAssist Hildith at the front gate\tHildith is at the front gate of Grimslade.\n6\tSpeak with Hildith once more\tHildith is at the front gate of Grimslade.\n7\tWait alongside Hildith and the guards of Grimslade\tHildith is at the front gate of Grimslade.\n8\tDefend Grimslade\tGrimslade is being attacked! Defend the city gate....\n9\tSpeak with the prisoner\tThe half-orc who was moments ago a prisoner of Grimslade now stands before the gates of town. You should speak with the prisoner.\n10\tStand your ground to defend Grimslade\tThe half-orc who was moments ago a prisoner of Grimslade now stands before the gates of town.\n11\tSpeak with Elfhelm\tElfhelm is with Hildith at the gate of Grimslade.\n",
[6936]="70020DAB\n1\tLleva a Gwin Curhonon a un lugar seguro\tAcompaña a Gwin Curhonon fuera de Khoblún Utot\n",
[6937]="7000D5B4\n1\tAsiste al Consejo de Narchuil\tAsiste al Consejo de Narchuil.\n",
[6938]="70046C4B\n1\tListen to Mablung's tale\tMablung recalls standing at the Halflings' camp-site. Mablung is telling you more of the tale of the Halflings in Ithilien. You should listen closely.\n2\tListen to Mablung's tale\tMablung recalls guarding the Halflings and speaking to them of their plans. Mablung is telling you more of the tale of the Halflings in Ithilien. You should listen closely.\n3\tListen to Mablung's tale\tMablung recalls the Southrons breaking through the trap. Mablung is telling you more of the tale of the Halflings in Ithilien. You should listen closely.\n4\tListen to Mablung's tale\tMablung recalls the wild Mûmak and the aftermath of the battle. Mablung is telling you more of the tale of the Halflings in Ithilien. You should listen closely.\n",
[6939]="700480D1\n1\tListen to Mablung's tale\tMablung recalls standing at the halflings' camp-site. Mablung is telling you more of the tale of the halflings in Ithilien. You should listen closely.\n2\tListen to Mablung's tale\tMablung recalls guarding the halflings and speaking to them of their plans. Mablung is telling you more of the tale of the halflings in Ithilien. You should listen closely.\n3\tListen to Mablung's tale\tMablung recalls the Southrons breaking through the trap. Mablung is telling you more of the tale of the halflings in Ithilien. You should listen closely.\n4\tListen to Mablung's tale\tMablung recalls the wild Mûmak and the aftermath of the battle. Mablung is telling you more of the tale of the halflings in Ithilien. You should listen closely.\n",
[6940]="7006EEE5\n1\tSpeak with Mizâdi at Dun Shûma\tSpeak with Mizâdi at Dun Shûma.\n2\tListen to the conversation between the leaders\tListen to the conversation between Mizâdi and the other leaders.\n3\tCheer with Mizâdi\tCheer with Mizâdi!\n4\tContinue listening to the conversation\tContinue listening to the conversation between Mizâdi and the other leaders.\n5\tListen to the conversation between Mizâdi and the other leaders\tContinue listening to the conversation between Mizâdi and the other leaders\n6\tGather pile of gifts Mizâdi brought.\t\n7\tGive Mizâdi's gift to Numûru\030Give Mizâdi's gift to Girhâzi\030Give Mizâdi's gift to Rahâzi\030Give Mizâdi's gift to Amalíbi\tGive gifts to each of the leaders.\n8\tListen to the conversation between Mizâdi and the other leaders\tListen to the conversation between Mizâdi and the other leaders.\n9\tListen to Mizâdi speak to the other leaders\tListen to the conversation between Mizâdi and the other leaders.\n10\tBow out of respect to Mizâdi\tBow out of respect to Mizâdi.\n11\tFinish listening to the conversation between Mizâdi and the other leaders\tFinish listening to the conversation between Mizâdi and the other leaders.\n12\tFinish listening to the conversation between Mizâdi and the other leaders\tFinish listening to the conversation between Mizâdi and the other leaders.\n",
[6941]="700385FD\n1\tHabla con el Thane Edric\tThane Edric can be found on the stairs to Meduseld in Edoras. You have arrived in Edoras and should now follow Edric as he seeks Éowyn.\n2\tFollow Thane Edric to Meduseld\tThane Edric can be found outside Meduseld in Edoras. You have ridden to Edoras with Thane Edric in search of Éowyn. You should follow Edric.\n3\tHabla con el Thane Edric\tThane Edric is standing outside the doors to Meduseld. Thane Edric is clearly overcome by his recent loss. You should speak to him.\n4\tWait with Thane Edric\tThane Edric is outside Meduseld in Edoras. Edric seeks an audience with Éowyn. You should wait at his side.\n5\tListen to Edric and Éowyn's conversation\tThane Edric is outside Meduseld. Éowyn has arrived in response to Edric's shouts. You should wait until Edric demands your account of the events on the road to Aldburg.\n6\tDefeat Thane Edric\tThane Edric can be found outside Meduseld in Edoras. Thane Edric has argued with Éowyn and has now drawn his blade against her. You must defeat him.\n7\tHabla con Éowyn fuera de Meduseld\tÉowyn can be found outside Meduseld in Edoras. You have defeated Edric, subduing him before his madness could inflict any harm on Éowyn. You should now speak to Éowyn.\n",
[6942]="7004137A\n1\tHabla con Langhár en las Ciénagas del Sur\tHas llegado con Langhár a las Ciénagas del Sur en busca de Ofolmóth. Ella espera hablar contigo antes de continuar hacia las ruinas donde se vio por última vez a tu pariente.\n2\tHabla con Ofolmóth\tHas encontrado a Ofolmóth, y se pregunta si has venido a unirte a él.\n3\tSobrevive a tu encuentro con Ofolmóth\tHas encontrado a Ofolmóth, pero ya no es de tu sangre. Ahora es tu enemigo.\n4\tHabla con Langhár en las ruinas\tOfolmóth te ha revelado sus intenciones. No acatará las leyes de los Hombres. Langhár desea hablar contigo antes de que comience el combate.\n5\tDerrota a Ofolmóth por sus crímenes contra la gente inocente\tOfolmóth ha herido gravemente a Langhár y debe ser derrotado.\n6\tHabla con Langhár en las ruinas\tLanghár ha sido herida de gravedad, pero sigue con vida.\n",
[6943]="700466F2\n1\tTalk to Mithrandir by the carcass of the fell-beast\tTalk to Mithrandir near the corpse of the fell-beast.\n2\tWrap the fell-beast head in the cloth\tWrap the head of the fell-beast in the heavy cloth given to you by Mithrandir.\n3\tBurn the carcass of the fell-beast\tNow that you have wrapped the head of the foul steed in heavy cloth, Mithrandir asked that you burn the corpse of the fell-beast.\n4\tTalk to Éomer by the burning carcass of the fell-beast\tTalk to Éomer on the Pelennor.\n5\tTalk to Mithrandir by the burning carcass of the fell-beast\tTalk to Mithrandir near the corpse of the fell-beast.\n6\tTravel to the Houses of Lore with Mithrandir\tTravel to the Houses of Lore with Mithrandir and deliver the head of the fell-beast to the scholars there.\n7\tRemain alert while Mithrandir speaks with the scholars at the Houses of Lore\tStand by as Mithrandir speaks with the scholars of the Houses of Lore.\n8\tTalk to Mithrandir in the Houses of Lore\tTalk to Mithrandir in the Houses of Lore.\n",
